  "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid",
  "type": "ImplementationProfile",
  "prefLabel": "Centroid",
  "definition": "Implementation Profile of the operation Centroid, whose meaning is its activity type (activityType): the signature of the Generic Profile Unary geometry operation, bound to data exchange formats.",
  "inScheme": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile",
  "hasAction": [
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/addition",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "addition",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-10-06T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/meaning-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/activity-type/centroid, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"The mathematical centroid for this Surface as a Point. The result is not guaranteed to be on this Surface.\"",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/operation-sources-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "The keyword ST_Centroid becomes an altLabel of the activity type; the sources defining the operation move to the activity type: OGC 99-049 OpenGIS Simple Features Specification For SQL, Revision 1.1, \u00a72.1.9.1 Centroid(); ISO/IEC 13249-3:2016 SQL multimedia and application packages -- Part 3: Spatial, ST_Centroid.",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/representation-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/geometry -> surface-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}); outputs/result -> point-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}).",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/tools-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Decision D4: 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/geometry: GML; outputs/result: GML); sources removed (tools, testbed, the bbox schema now in the representation's format): ZOO-Project Geonovum testbed -- Centroid: Computes the centroid of a polygon. <https://host1.tb.geonovum.geolabs.fr/ogc-api/processes/Centroid>; description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles.",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/sections-restored-2026-11-09",
      "type": "RegisterAction",
      "actionType": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/amendmentAction",
      "changeClassification": "clarifying",
      "description": "Corrects what https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09.",
      "proposer": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/geolabs",
      "startedAtTime": "2026-11-09T00:00:00Z",
      "appliesTo": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid"
    }
  ],
  "objectIdentifier": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/centroid",
  "itemClass": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/item-class/implementation-profile",
  "inRegister": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/register",
  "validityStatus": "invalid",
  "publicationStatus": "published",
  "refinesGenericProfile": "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/generic-profile/unary-geometry-operation",
